      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Escorpião Voador. Gligar constrói seu ninho em penhascos íngremes. Depois de planar, volta para casa saltando pelo chão. Ele desliza pelo ar e surpreende os inimigos ao se prender em seus rostos, atacando em seguida com seu ferrão venenoso.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Gligar pode evoluir para Gliscor no nível 11 ou superior enquanto segura uma Razor Fang à noite. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Poison Sting</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Harden</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Fury Cutter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint Attack, Poison Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>U-turn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>X-Scissor</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Crabhammer, Sky Uppercut, Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Guillotine</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Aqua Tail, Attract, Baton Pass, Breaking Swipe, Brick Break, Bug Bite, Bulldoze, Confide, Crunch, Dark Pulse, Defog, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Wingbeat, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fire Fang, Fling, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Ice Fang, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Lunge, Metal Claw, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Payback, Poison Jab, Poison Tail, Protect, Psychic Fangs, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Roost, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scale Shot, Scary Face, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Spikes, Stealth Rock, Steel Wing, Stone Edge, Struggle Bug, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Tailwind, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Thunder Fang, Torment, Toxic, Toxic Spikes, U-turn, Venoshock, X-Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Baton Pass, Counter, Cross Poison, Double-Edge, Feint, Metal Claw, Night Slash, Poison Tail, Power Trick, Razor Wind, Rock Climb, Sand Tomb, Wing Attack</p>",
